  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In February and March 2024, the Federal Acquisition Service promoted FAST24 virtual training events that included leveraging AI as a Service. In 2023, FAS highlighted AI alongside cybersecurity and telecom as technologies impacting the future of IT solutions and promoted related training. In a February 2026 webinar document, FAS stated that it intends to incorporate Government Terms and Conditions for AI Systems for AI systems or services offered under the MAS Solicitation, pursuant to OMB memorandum M-25-22.",
   "sids": [
